P and open it in Godot master HEAD.\n3. Run the demo and select the DroidCam device from the list.\n4. Observe: the camera feed is shown in grayscale and duplicated into two side-by-side halves instead of the correct image.\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhttps://github.com/shiena/godot-camerafeed-demo","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119851/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119851/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}